@startuml seq_m6_parent_dashboard
!include _style.iuml
autonumber "<b>0."
hide footbox

title Sequence Diagram, Module 6: Parent Zone gate, dashboard and PDF report (FR-10, FR-12; FR-NEW-TEL planned)

actor "Parent or Teacher" as Adult
participant "ArithmeticGuardDialog" as Gate
participant "ArithmeticGateManager" as GateMgr
participant "ParentDashboardScreen" as Screen
participant "ParentDashboardViewModel" as VM
participant "ProfileRepository" as Profiles
participant "ReportGenerator" as Report
participant "LetterStatusCalculator\nRetentionCalculator" as Calc
participant "PdfExporter" as Pdf
database "Room" as DB
participant "CsvExportManager\n<<planned>>" as Csv #F2F2F2

== Arithmetic gate (keeps young children out) ==
Adult -> Gate : taps Parent Zone
activate Gate
Gate -> GateMgr : generateProblem()
GateMgr --> Gate : ArithmeticProblem ("7 + 5 = ?")
Adult -> Gate : types the answer
Gate -> GateMgr : validateAnswer(problem, input)
alt correct
  GateMgr --> Gate : true
  Gate -> Screen : onPass(): open the dashboard
else wrong
  GateMgr --> Gate : false
  Gate -> GateMgr : generateProblem() (new problem)
end
deactivate Gate

== Dashboard ==
activate Screen
Screen -> VM : create
activate VM
VM -> Profiles : getAllProfiles() (Flow)
Profiles -> DB : SELECT profiles (+ live star totals)
Profiles --> VM : profiles
VM -> VM : selectProfile(first or current)
VM -> Report : generateDashboardData(profileId)
activate Report
Report -> DB : via its repositories: lesson_progress, say_it_attempts,\nfind_it_attempts, blend_it_progress, phonemes
Report -> Calc : calculateStatus(accuracy, failedAttempts)\ncalculate7DayRetention(...)
Calc --> Report : RiskStatus (GREEN, YELLOW, RED), retention
Report --> VM : ProfileDashboardData
deactivate Report
VM --> Screen : uiState (stars, accuracy, letter table, at-risk list)

== PDF report (FR-12) ==
Adult -> Screen : taps Export PDF
Screen -> VM : exportPdfReport()
VM --> Screen : exportStatus = Exporting
VM -> Report : generateReportData(profileId)
Report --> VM : ReportData
VM -> Pdf : exportReport(reportData)
Pdf -> Pdf : draw pages with Android PdfDocument,\nwrite to app-specific storage (no network)
Pdf --> VM : Result<File>
alt success
  VM --> Screen : exportStatus = Success(file): share or open
else failure
  VM --> Screen : exportStatus = Error(message)
end

== Planned: telemetry CSV export (FR-NEW-TEL, SDD 3.5.2) ==
Adult -[#9E9E9E]> Screen : taps Export telemetry (CSV)
Screen -[#9E9E9E]> Csv : exportCsv(profileId)
Csv -[#9E9E9E]> DB : read telemetry_events (schema v4)
Csv -[#9E9E9E]> Adult : Android share sheet (ACTION_SEND)
note over Csv #F2F2F2 : not built yet: needs Room v4\nand a migration (SDD 2.0)
deactivate VM
deactivate Screen
@enduml
